<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telesp 10-mo net 630.88 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telesp 10-mo net 630.88 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecoms firm Telesp, a unit of the federal Telebras system serving Sao Paulo state, released the following 10-month 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>		     Jan-Oct 1996	Jan-Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Net		  630.88 million	   N/A</p>
<p>    Net Revs	   2.92 bln	     N/A</p>
<p>    Gross Revs	 3.937 bln	    N/A</p>
<p>Note: The figures are all in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
</text>
